nd off no later than 3.5 hours in — if the full scope cannot be finished, hand off a reviewable slice with the remaining items enumerated precisely in the results. Attach TASK-260830-1geqhj_results.md, TASK-260830-1geqhj_conformance-matrix.md and TASK-260830-1geqhj_producer-evidence.tar.gz (a real gzip archive), keep the checklist current, then `task-board handoff TASK-260830-1geqhj --role developer` and exit promptly. Canonical CLI /Users/iv/.curator/global/bin/task-board. Model: muse-spark max. The independent reviewer will be claude-opus-5 max.","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"read_file","outcome":"success"}}}
