t four narrowing mutants of your own on the new assertion families (state-dir census ignoring one directory; disconnect classification collapsing transport_failure into authentication_failed; rotation admitting before enrollment for one peer; concurrent-mutation fence off by one generation) plus an applied harmless SURVIVED control; per-plant raw logs, subprocess exits, precise denominators. (7) Story-close items — ownership registry: AC-HOST-001 registered over the suite, new unevidenced bindings 11.10.1-11.10.4 + 16.1, 6.6/11.10 gaps refreshed, 11.10.5 unowned by design; reviewedOwnershipCanonicalSHA256 re-pinned over the merged registry (trunk rows + this Story's rows): recompute the projection digest independently, confirm every claimed clause line exists and each binding names an existing declaration driven by an acceptance case (plant a self-minted claim — refused), tracecheck counts reproduced; README/hostchannel README with test commands and no capability claim (no ax command); LOGBOOK newest-first with every Story entry plus trunk's 3lt2xv. (8) Hygiene — changed_paths carry no __pycache__/.pyc/stray plants or leftover sshd state; gofmt/vet clean; go test ./internal/hostchannel ./internal/rpcwire ./internal/hosttrust ./internal/traceability/... -count=1 and -race green; tracecheck and `cataloggen -adopted -output internal/catalog/catalog_gen.go -check` exit 0 on the exact tree.\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 9819,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 2455,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"bash","outcome":"success"}}}
